<title>ITALY: Italy records bop surplus in January.</title>
<headline>Italy records bop surplus in January.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 5.322 trillion lire surplus in January, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     Jan 97	  Dec 96    Jan 96</p>
<p> Total		     +5,322	  -2,960	 -7</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  +5,322	 +19,602	 -7</p>
<p> Capital movements    +12,758	  -2,812     +222</p>
<p>  -Year to date	 +12,758	  -7,219     +222</p>
